        {
          "content": "\u003cp\u003eDue to ongoing restoration work, operations to create and manage resources in the Compute Cloud service are temporarily unavailable. This makes it impossible to create and modify resources in dependent services: Managed Service for Kubernetes, Managed Service for MySQL, Managed Service for PostgreSQL and other managed databases.\u003cbr /\u003e\nExisting previously created resources continue to work.\u003c/p\u003e\n",
